# Abstract
# --------
# Fuzzing engine and the one runtime dependency that the fuzz targets in
# fuzz/ import. `make lock` compiles this file into requirements-ci-fuzz.txt
# with a SHA-256 hash for every distribution, and the fuzzing workflow
# installs it with `pip install --require-hashes` (OpenSSF Scorecard,
# Pinned-Dependencies). The package itself is installed with --no-deps.
# =============================================================================

atheris  # Coverage-guided fuzzing engine for Python (libFuzzer).
numpy  # Arrays, used by the GeoJSON functions under test.

